  {"date": "2018-10-28", "venue": "Allstate Arena", "city": "Rosemont", "state": "IL", "gap": 46, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "A pleasant surprise from Fall 2018, as out of the final verse the band vamps on the usual \"No Quarter\" jam, before Page leads them into a brief but lovely major key jam with some nice Trey soloing. Grows briefly funky thanks to Page on clavinet, before Trey hits on the opening chords to \"Cities\", leading to a nifty ->.", "out": "->", "prev": "Carini", "in": ">", "next": "Cities", "nb": 1},
